<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Quote Card</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #121212;
      font-family: Arial;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      color: white;
    }
    .quote {
      background: #1f1f1f;
      padding: 30px;
      width: 300px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .quote:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      background: #292929;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="quote">
  <h3>Quote of the Day</h3>
  <p>"Discipline beats motivation every time."</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
